:{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124416","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124416.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124416.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:35Z"},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124384\n\nMenuBar was using emulated mouse events, which are propagated before the actual touch events. As a result, the emulated mouse event triggered the popup, and the subsequent touch event was passed to the PopupMenu. Since the touch event occurred outside the popup's area, it caused the popup to close right after opeing it.\n\nThis PR updates MenuBar to use actual touch input to trigger the popup, avoiding this issue.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124416/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124416/timeline","